  "id": "executive-coaching",
  "term": "executive coaching",
  "definition": "Executive coaching is a work-based developmental process for people with managerial responsibility that supports changes aimed at improving professional performance and personal goals. In organizations, it is used to promote positive change and development, often by building new habits, attitudes, and work practices.",
